#!/usr/bin/env bash

lord --verbose << "EOF"
Add me a make target 'make cover' that creates a super minimal exterior front+spine+back with the default simple title page from dark mode here: Back can be blank. Spine should say whatever you think looks good, with Genesis small, probably written so that it's horizontal when the book is on the shelf.

It's for Kindle Direct Publishing, and should produce the format they want.
EOF
